repository: "https://github.com/alferso2/UPMpyTMD-public"
keywords:
  - spacecraft thermal analysis
  - ESATAN
  - TMD
  - post-processing
abstract: >-
  Local web application for post-processing ESATAN TMD thermal results:
  node grouping, group attributes, conductive and radiative heat flow,
  interface temperature gradients, CSG stability, requirement verification
  and thermal report generation.
